WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.300
Step six collects the second week, as
of November sixteenth: seven notices.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:08.698
A new post, M C nine
hundred thousand and five,

3
00:00:08.698 --> 00:00:13.700
is a change due February twenty-eighth,
2027, a date Microsoft set.

4
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:16.965
The SharePoint post's title
now starts with updated,

5
00:00:16.965 --> 00:00:20.762
so its fingerprint changes, and
Module 7 will update its task.

6
00:00:20.762 --> 00:00:22.462
And the incident is closed.

7
00:00:22.462 --> 00:00:25.850
Step seven builds the live
request without sending it.

8
00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:29.428
The first line prints
the messages U R L on the

9
00:00:29.428 --> 00:00:32.813
worldwide Graph host,
the right one for G C C.

10
00:00:32.813 --> 00:00:37.679
Then it tries a next link on another
host, graph dot example dot net,

11
00:00:37.679 --> 00:00:41.374
and the kit refuses it: it
isn't on the G C C Graph host.

12
00:00:41.374 --> 00:00:44.550
That's the guard that keeps the
token on the tenant's own host.

13
00:00:44.550 --> 00:00:49.162
Step eight runs this chapter's
tests: fifteen pass, none fail.

14
00:00:49.162 --> 00:00:51.050
Then delete the output folder.
